slides.body:
Using the file included in the “Acquisizione_BOA.7z”, using CANalyzer tool, reply to the following
points:
1. Create a graph showing only engine rpm;
2. Create a graph including only the most important signals, describing different dynamic
vehicle conditions; Choose only the signals which are useful to understand the status of the
vehicle, what the driver was doing, general useful information;
3. Analysing the data, try to find out what is a potential issue in the maneuvre recorded in the
log;
4. Write a report which explains the activity done, describing also the issue in point 3;
